For instance:

```js
// runs on each benchmark task's cycle
bench.addEventListener("cycle", (e) => {
  const task = e.task!;
});

// runs only on this benchmark task's cycle
task.addEventListener("cycle", (e) => {
  const task = e.task!;
});
```

